      "id": "claim_01d47cc52b5042a5b8582d92d492526d",
      "statement": "`load_config()` chooses the first existing configuration file in the order `./transcriber.toml`, then `~/.config/transcriber/config.toml`; it validates an existing TOML document as `TranscriberConfig` and otherwise returns a default model, including when an explicit path does not exist.",
